---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Elate Case Study · Phil Tarnowski" description="How I helped grow Elate from $20K ARR and fewer than 10 customers to a Series A, including four AI modules built on Gemini." image="/og/elate.png">
<section style="background: #102A38">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 32px 56px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; align-items: center">
    <div style="flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px">
        <a href="https://www.goelate.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display: inline-block"><img src="/images/logo-elate.png" alt="Elate website" style="height: 40px; width: auto; display: block"></a>
        
      </div>
      <h1 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(40px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: 0.005em; max-width: 14ch">From $20K ARR to a Series A</h1>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #D8D8D8; max-width: 48ch"><a href="https://www.goelate.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4AB8D4; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px">Elate</a> is an AI-powered strategy execution platform. I joined as employee #5 and the first product hire, and led discovery, design, product strategy, the roadmap, and delivery as we grew to a Series A.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0; max-width: 600px">
      <div style="overflow: hidden; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #33363D; background: #F7F7F9">
        <img src="/images/elate-reporting-assistant-crop.png" alt="Elate's AI Reporting Assistant drafting a status update with Strategy Advisor" width="1069" height="750" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block">
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #102A38">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px clamp(40px, 5vw, 56px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(220px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #FFFFFF">&lt;10 → 100+</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">Customers</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">From Pre-Seed to Series A</p></div>
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #FFFFFF">200%+</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">ARR growth</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">In back-to-back years</p></div>
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #FFFFFF">4</p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">AI modules shipped</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">Built on Gemini models</p></div>
      <div style="background: #163A4D; border: 1px solid #1C4A5F; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1; color: #FFFFFF">Pre-Seed → <span style="white-space: nowrap">Series A</span></p><p style="margin: 14px 0 4px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600">$9M+ raised total</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #A9C2CE">Starting from $20K ARR</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 72px">
    <div style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0">
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">The Starting Point</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 999 1 520px; min-width: 0">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #D8D8D8">When I joined, Elate had fewer than 10 customers and $20K in ARR. There was no product function, no analytics, no delivery process, and no roadmap.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #D8D8D8">My job was to build all of it while shipping a product customers loved and would pay for.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #D8D8D8">I started where I always start: customer interviews and market research, to learn how strategy leaders actually worked and where the tools around them fell short.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #EDEAE3; color: #1C1C1E">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">The Product Journey</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444444; max-width: 62ch">What product looked like at each stage, and what it took to reach the next one.</p>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px; align-items: stretch">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E0DDD5; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
          <span style="align-self: flex-start; background: #1C1C1E; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600">Early</span>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">Path to Product-Market Fit</p>
            <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555555">Fewer than 10 customers. No product function, analytics, or roadmap.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #F3F1EA; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555555">Product team</p>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #A6DCEB"></span></div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600">Me and a fractional product designer</p>
          </div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333"><span style="font-weight: 600">The product focus:</span> Build the foundation: a prioritization and roadmap process, product analytics, activation and retention metrics, a delivery process, and a redesign of the core platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E0DDD5; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
          <span style="align-self: flex-start; background: #1C1C1E; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600">Growing</span>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">200%+ ARR growth</p>
            <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555555">In back-to-back years, as the customer base grew.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #F3F1EA; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555555">Product team</p>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span></div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600">Me, a product manager, and a fractional product designer</p>
          </div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333"><span style="font-weight: 600">The product focus:</span> Own the whole customer workflow. 30+ customer interviews led to a reporting module and improved collaboration features that increased engagement and drove expansion.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: auto"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E0DDD5"><span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; color: #1E7E96; flex: 0 0 auto">100%+</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #444444; line-height: 1.4">net revenue retention</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E0DDD5; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
          <span style="align-self: flex-start; background: #1C1C1E; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600">Series A</span>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">$9M+ raised total</p>
            <p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555555">100+ customers and multi-million ARR.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #F3F1EA; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555555">Product &amp; Engineering Team</p>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px" aria-hidden="true"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px; background: #4AB8D4"></span></div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600">Led a team of nine across product, design, and engineering</p>
          </div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333"><span style="font-weight: 600">The product focus:</span> Turn AI into revenue with four AI modules, led by Strategy Advisor and Plan Analyzer, built around how customers already worked.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: auto"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E0DDD5"><span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; color: #1E7E96; flex: 0 0 auto">2</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #444444; line-height: 1.4">best upsell quarters in company history</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E0DDD5"><span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; color: #1E7E96; flex: 0 0 auto">40%</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #444444; line-height: 1.4">faster customer migration</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #1C1C1E">
  <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
    <div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 32px 48px">
        <div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px 16px; margin-bottom: 12px">
          <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">Reporting Module</h2>
          <span style="display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #C0C0C0">Over its first year</span>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #A0A0A0; max-width: 62ch">Built from learning the pain points and workflows after 30+ customer interviews. Reporting helped strategy leaders build, schedule, and share reports and run their review meetings inside Elate.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 24px">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 12px); min-width: 130px; border-top: 1px solid #33363D; padding-top: 20px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #4AB8D4">100%+</p><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #C0C0C0">Net revenue retention</p></div><div style="flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 12px); min-width: 130px; border-top: 1px solid #33363D; padding-top: 20px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #4AB8D4">+19 pts</p><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #C0C0C0">3-month admin retention above the <a href="https://www.pendo.io/product-benchmarks/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4AB8D4; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px">median Pendo benchmark</a></p></div>
        </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; max-width: 480px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 20px; padding: 12px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <img src="/images/elate-report-builder.png" alt="Elate's Create a New Report screen with Build With Advisor Assistance and an Elate-generated department progress report" width="1120" height="910" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-top: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px)">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row-reverse; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 32px 48px">
        <div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px 16px; margin-bottom: 12px">
          <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">Collaboration Features</h2>
          <span style="display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #33363D; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #C0C0C0">Compared with the year before</span>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #A0A0A0; max-width: 62ch">Nudges, editing upgrades, share links, improved text editors, and report collaboration. Enabled teams to work in Elate together instead of around it.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 24px">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 12px); min-width: 130px; border-top: 1px solid #33363D; padding-top: 20px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #4AB8D4">+5%</p><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #C0C0C0">12-month user retention</p></div><div style="flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 12px); min-width: 130px; border-top: 1px solid #33363D; padding-top: 20px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #4AB8D4">+15 min</p><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #C0C0C0">Average daily time per account</p></div><div style="flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 12px); min-width: 130px; border-top: 1px solid #33363D; padding-top: 20px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #4AB8D4">+121%</p><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #C0C0C0">Comments</p></div><div style="flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 12px); min-width: 130px; border-top: 1px solid #33363D; padding-top: 20px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; color: #4AB8D4">+78%</p><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #C0C0C0">Status updates</p></div>
        </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; max-width: 480px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 20px; padding: 12px; box-sizing: border-box">
          <img src="/images/elate-status-update.png" alt="Elate's status update form with a comment drafted by Strategy Advisor and a status update quality indicator" width="1120" height="910" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">Four AI Modules Built Around Real Problems</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 62ch">We built AI into the workflows strategy leaders already ran, using Gemini models, and priced it in a way that meaningfully drove expansion revenue.</p>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 440px), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; border-top: 4px solid #4AB8D4">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #68675F">Flagship AI Product</p>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1"><a href="https://www.goelate.com/ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgba(26, 110, 134, 0.45); text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 4px">Strategy Advisor</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444444">I defined the use cases and the interaction model, worked with engineering on the delivery and improvement, and partnered with sales and marketing on positioning, packaging, and pricing.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #E0DDD5"><span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; color: #1A6E86">2</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #444444">best upsell quarters in company history</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; border-top: 4px solid #4AB8D4">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #68675F">Sales &amp; Onboarding Accelerator</p>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1"><a href="https://www.goelate.com/ai/plan-analyzer" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgba(26, 110, 134, 0.45); text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 4px">Plan Analyzer</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444444">Strategic plans live in slides and spreadsheets. Plan Analyzer reads those files and maps them into Elate with AI, eliminating manual effort during implementations and reducing customer time to value.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #E0DDD5"><span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; color: #1A6E86">40%</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #444444">faster customer migration</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 440px), 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px">
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px 32px">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #68675F">Early Warning System</p>
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1"><a href="https://www.goelate.com/ai/risk-navigator" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgba(26, 110, 134, 0.45); text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 4px">Risk Navigator</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444444">Flags risks across teams, timelines, and outcomes before they spiral, blending Elate data with the sentiment in team updates.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding-top: 16px; margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #E0DDD5"><span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; color: #1A6E86">2</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: #444444">best upsell quarters in company history</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px 32px">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #68675F">Reporting Engine</p>
